{"title": "False Life", "pageid": 2178, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/False_Life", "categories": ["Spells that last until long rest", "Spells", "Level 1 Spells", "Necromancy spells", "Spells that gain benefits at higher levels", "Spells that can be transcribed", "Actions", "Sources of Temporary HP"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:False_Life.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/45/False_Life.webp/300px-False_Life.webp, /w/images/4/45/False_Life.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/45/False_Life.webp/300px-False_Life.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/45/False_Life.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>False Life </b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Spells\" title=\"Spells\">level 1 necromancy spell</a>. It allows spellcasters to gain <a href=\"/wiki/Hit_Points#Temporary_Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hit Points\">Temporary Hit Points</a>.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Bolster yourself with a necromantic facsimile of life to gain <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/38px-HP_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"7 temporary hit points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> 7 <a href=\"/wiki/Temporary_Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Temporary Hit Points\">temporary hit points</a>. \n</p>\n<span style=\"color: white;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/25px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/38px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Prerequisite Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/25px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><span class=\"bg3wiki-prereq\">Can only have temporary hit points from one source.</span></span><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a> + <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/25px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/38px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/25px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spell_slots\" title=\"Spells\">Level 1 Spell Slot</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: Self\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: Self</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"At_higher_levels\"> At higher levels </span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Upcasting\" title=\"Upcasting\">Upcasting</a>: Casting this spell at a higher level yields an extra <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/38px-HP_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"5 temporary hit points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> 5 <a href=\"/wiki/Temporary_Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Temporary Hit Points\">temporary hit points</a> for each spell slot level above 1st.\n</p>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Shout_FalseLife</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_FalseLife\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_FalseLife\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/wiki/HasSomaticComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasSomaticComponent (spell flag)\">HasSomaticComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/HasVerbalComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasVerbalComponent (spell flag)\">HasVerbalComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsSpell_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsSpell (spell flag)\">IsSpell</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_False_Life\"> Condition: False Life </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/False_Life_(Condition)\" title=\"False Life (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4e/False_Life_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-False_Life_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4e/False_Life_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-False_Life_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4e/False_Life_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-False_Life_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"False Life\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4e/False_Life_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-False_Life_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4e/False_Life_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/False_Life_(Condition)\" title=\"False Life (Condition)\">False Life</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: Until <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a></p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Gain <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/38px-HP_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"7 temporary hit points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> 7 <a href=\"/wiki/Temporary_Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Temporary Hit Points\">temporary hit points</a> plus 5 additional for each spell slot level above the first.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\nClasses: <ul><li> Class level 1: <a href=\"/wiki/Sorcerer\" title=\"Sorcerer\">Sorcerer</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">Wizard</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Death_Domain\" title=\"Death Domain\">Death Domain</a> (Domain Spell)</li><li> Class level 3: <a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Trickster\" title=\"Arcane Trickster\">Arcane Trickster</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Eldritch_Knight\" title=\"Eldritch Knight\">Eldritch Knight</a></li><li> Class level 6: <a href=\"/wiki/College_of_Lore\" title=\"College of Lore\">College of Lore</a> (via <a href=\"/wiki/Magical_Secrets\" title=\"Magical Secrets\">Magical Secrets</a>)</li><li> Class level 10: <a href=\"/wiki/Bard\" title=\"Bard\">Bard</a> (via <a href=\"/wiki/Magical_Secrets\" title=\"Magical Secrets\">Magical Secrets</a>)</li></ul>\nGranted by features: <ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Initiate:_Sorcerer\" title=\"Magic Initiate: Sorcerer\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Magic_Initiate_Sorcerer_Icon.webp/25px-Magic_Initiate_Sorcerer_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Magic_Initiate_Sorcerer_Icon.webp/38px-Magic_Initiate_Sorcerer_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Magic_Initiate_Sorcerer_Icon.webp/50px-Magic_Initiate_Sorcerer_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Magic Initiate: Sorcerer\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Magic_Initiate_Sorcerer_Icon.webp/25px-Magic_Initiate_Sorcerer_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c0/Magic_Initiate_Sorcerer_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Initiate:_Sorcerer\" title=\"Magic Initiate: Sorcerer\">Magic Initiate: Sorcerer</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Initiate:_Wizard\" title=\"Magic Initiate: Wizard\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp/25px-Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp/38px-Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp/50px-Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Magic Initiate: Wizard\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp/25px-Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3d/Magic_Initiate_Wizard_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Initiate:_Wizard\" title=\"Magic Initiate: Wizard\">Magic Initiate: Wizard</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Other ways to learn:<br>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Also granted to <a href=\"/wiki/Warlock\" title=\"Warlock\">Warlocks</a> who choose the <a href=\"/wiki/Eldritch_Invocation\" title=\"Eldritch Invocation\">Eldritch Invocation</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fiendish_Vigour\" title=\"Fiendish Vigour\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/False_Life_Icon.webp/20px-False_Life_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/False_Life_Icon.webp/30px-False_Life_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/False_Life_Icon.webp/40px-False_Life_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fiendish Vigour\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/False_Life_Icon.webp/20px-False_Life_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/False_Life_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fiendish_Vigour\" title=\"Fiendish Vigour\">Fiendish Vigour</a> at level 2+. When gained in this way, the spell can be cast at will and doesn't expend <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spell_Slots\" title=\"Spells\">Spell Slots</a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">Wizards</a>  can <a href=\"/wiki/Transcribing_scrolls\" title=\"Transcribing scrolls\">transcribe</a> a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_False_Life\" title=\"Scroll of False Life\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Scroll_of_False_Life_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Scroll_of_False_Life_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Scroll_of_False_Life_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Scroll_of_False_Life_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Scroll_of_False_Life_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Scroll_of_False_Life_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Scroll_of_False_Life_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Scroll_of_False_Life_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Scroll_of_False_Life_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_False_Life\" title=\"Scroll of False Life\">Scroll of False Life</a> to their spellbooks.</li></ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>If a wizard casts False Life on themselves, this spell must remain <a href=\"/wiki/Prepared_spells\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Prepared spells\">prepared</a>. Removing it from the Prepared Spells list immediately removes the applied bonus. If applied by using a <a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_False_Life\" title=\"Scroll of False Life\">scroll</a> directly, instead of <a href=\"/wiki/Transcribing_scrolls\" title=\"Transcribing scrolls\">transcribing</a> it into a wizard's spellbook, the caster need not keep the spell prepared.</li>\n<li>The incantation for False Life is <b>Dum Vita Est, Spes Est</b>, Latin for <i>\"While there is life, there is hope\"</i>.</li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Visuals\"> Visuals </span></h2>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><div class=\"embedvideo-wrapper embedvideo--local-embed-style\" style=\"position: relative;\"><div class=\"embedvideo-localEmbedStyle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"embedvideo-overlay\"><div class=\"embedvideo-loader\"><div class=\"embedvideo-loader__fakeButton\">Play Video</div><div class=\"embedvideo-loader__footer\"><div class=\"embedvideo-loader__service\">Local File</div></div></div></div></div><video src=\"https://bg3.wiki/w/images/c/c9/False_Life_Visuals.mp4\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 640px; height: auto;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://bg3.wiki/wiki/File:False_Life_Visuals.mp4\">https://bg3.wiki/wiki/File:False_Life_Visuals.mp4</a></video></div></span> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/False_life\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"False life\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/False_life\">False life</a></span> on the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Main_Page\">Forgotten Realms Wiki</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715035732\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.102 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.111 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4